<title>NETHERLANDS: WOLTERS RAISES DIV PAYOUT RATIO TO 35 PCT.</title>
<headline>WOLTERS RAISES DIV PAYOUT RATIO TO 35 PCT.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Publisher Wolters Kluwer NV said on Friday it was raising its dividend payout ratio to about 35 percent from just over 30 percent in recent years.</p>
</text>
